WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.302
THE SEARCH FOR SURVIVORS PRESSES
ON.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:05.271
THIS AFTER A RUSSIAN MISSILE
SLAMMED INTO AN APARTMENT

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:09.209
BUILDING OVER THE WEEKEND, AT
LEAST 30 PEOPLE WERE KILLED AND

00:00:09.209 --> 00:00:11.377
DOZENS OF OTHERS ARE STILL
MISSING.

00:00:11.377 --> 00:00:15.248
MANY ARE HOLDING OUT HOPE FOR
MORE SCENES LIKE THIS.

00:00:15.248 --> 00:00:19.152
THE RESCUE OF A WOMAN FROM THE
RUBBLE FOLLOWING SATURDAY'S

00:00:19.152 --> 00:00:23.957
STRIKE DNIPRO'S MAYOR IS
ACKNOWLEDGING A HARSH REALITY.

00:00:23.957 --> 00:00:29.162
&gt;&gt; I THINK THE CHANCES OF
SAVING PEOPLE NOW ARE MINIMAL.

00:00:29.162 --> 00:00:32.398
MY VERSION IS THAT THE MISSILE
HIT THE BUILDING BECAUSE THERE

00:00:32.398 --> 00:00:35.101
IS A THERMAL STATION ACROSS THE
RIVER MEANING THEY TRIED TO HIT

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:38.204
THE THERMAL STATION.
THE MISSILE FLEW BY AND HIT

00:00:38.204 --> 00:00:42.008
RESIDENTIAL BUILDINGS.
&gt;&gt; UKRAINE'S PRESIDENT SAYS THE

00:00:42.008 --> 00:00:45.078
SEARCH WILL GO ON AS LONG AS
THERE IS A CHANCE TO SAVE

00:00:45.078 --> 00:00:49.015
LIVES.
HE HAD THIS MESSAGE OR RUSSIANS

00:00:49.015 --> 00:00:52.018
REMAINING SILENT AMID THE
VIOLENCE.

00:00:52.018 --> 00:00:59.058
&gt;&gt; I WANT TO SAY TO ALL THOSE
IN RUSSIA AND FROM RUSSIA WILL

00:00:59.058 --> 00:01:02.061
EVEN KNOW COULD UTTER A FEW
WORDS OF CONDEMNATION OF THIS

00:01:02.061 --> 00:01:07.000
TERROR, ALTHOUGH THEY SEE AND
COMPREHEND EVERYTHING PERFECTLY,

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.270
YOUR COWARDLY SILENCE, YOUR
ATTEMPT TO WEED OUT WHAT IS

00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:14.107
HAPPENING WILL ONLY END WITH
THE FACT THAT ONE DAY, THESE

00:01:14.107 --> 00:01:17.043
SAME TERRORISTS WILL COME FOR
YOU.

00:01:17.043 --> 00:01:25.284
&gt;&gt; WELL CNN'S FRED PLEITGEN
TRAVELED TO THE DEVASTATION

00:01:25.284 --> 00:01:31.090
LEFT BEHIND WITH THE DESPERATE
SEARCH FOR SURVIVORS.

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:34.294
.
&gt;&gt; THIS SCENE, APOCALYPTIC AS

00:01:34.294 --> 00:01:37.263
RESCUES FRENETICALLY SIFT
THROUGH THE DEBRIS SEARCHING

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:41.067
FOR SURVIVORS, THE HOPE OF
FINDING ANY FADING BY THE

00:01:41.067 --> 00:01:43.436
SECOND AS THE COLD NIGHT
PROGRESSES.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:47.106
FOR SOME, THE GRIEF IS TOO MUCH
TO HANDLE.

00:01:47.106 --> 00:01:54.747
&gt;&gt; SHE SAYS SHE PASSED BY THIS
BUILDING ABOUT ONLY HALF AN

00:01:54.747 --> 00:01:59.686
HOUR BEFORE IT WAS HIT.
THERE ARE MANY FRIENDS AND

00:01:59.686 --> 00:02:02.088
FAMILIES CLOSE TO HERE, SHE
SAYS.

00:02:02.088 --> 00:02:07.594
--
STUNNED BY THE SCALE OF THE

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:09.229
DESTRUCTION, VERSUS THE
RUSSIANS.

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:17.804
I SIMPLY HATE THEM, CHILDREN,
PEOPLE DIED HERE, AND SHE CAN'T

00:02:17.804 --> 00:02:26.412
SPEAK ANYMORE.
ON TOP OF THE MANY, KILLED

00:02:26.412 --> 00:02:30.416
DOZENS WERE INJURED, AND MANY
MORE REMAIN MISSING THAN JUST

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:33.620
THIS ONE LOCATION IN DNIPRO
AFTER RUSSIA HIT SITES ACROSS

00:02:33.620 --> 00:02:36.222
UKRAINE WITH BRUSHES OF
MISSILES THIS WEEKEND.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.626
UKRAINIANS SAY THEY ARE
ABSOLUTELY CERTAIN THE MISSILE

00:02:39.626 --> 00:02:43.596
