POUNDS.

00:02:50.036 --> 00:02:54.407
AS YOU CAN, SEE IT ABSOLUTELY
ANNIHILATED THE BUILDING,

00:02:54.407 --> 00:02:56.142
BURYING DOZENS OF PEOPLE
UNDERNEATH.

00:02:56.142 --> 00:02:59.679
RUSSIA HAS NOT DIRECTLY
COMMENTED ON THE THAT LEE

00:02:59.679 --> 00:03:05.451
STRIKE IN DNIPRO, BUT THE PATH
MOSCOW HAS DENIED FORCES

00:03:05.451 --> 00:03:07.620
RESIDENTIAL AREAS.
THE UKRAINIANS CALLED THE

00:03:07.620 --> 00:03:11.457
ATTACK STATE TERRORISM, AND THE
PRESIDENT SAYS RESCUERS WILL

00:03:11.457 --> 00:03:14.260
CONTINUE TO TRY AND SAFE ANYONE
TRAPPED HERE.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:19.432
LET'S FIGHT FOR EVERY PERSON,
PRESIDENT ZELENSKYY SAYS, THE

00:03:19.432 --> 00:03:22.435
RESCUE OPERATION WILL LAST AS
LONG AS THERE IS EVEN THE

00:03:22.435 --> 00:03:23.869
SLIGHTEST CHANCE TO SAVE A
LIFE.

00:03:23.869 --> 00:03:28.474
BUT EVEN THE SLIGHTEST HOPE IS
FADING FAST, AND THIS COULD

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:31.844
SOON TURN FROM A RESCUE INTO A
RECOVERY OPERATION.

00:03:31.844 --> 00:03:35.514
CREWS SEARCHING FOR BODIES
WHERE SO MANY LIVES OR

00:03:35.514 --> 00:03:39.118
VIOLENTLY ENDED IN AN INSTANT.
FRED PLEITGEN, CNN, DNIPRO,

00:03:39.118 --> 00:03:51.664
UKRAINE.
&gt;&gt; [SOUND OF ARTILLERY]

